equest absence must coexist with sleeping open TX\/snapshot before finally. Fresh bounded cleanup token must not inherit cancelled work token. Own rollback and guard-checked management KILL paths, retained TX IDs including active_transactions after session mapping gone, session\/request\/TX\/snapshot release and exact resource ownership\/cleanup must be sound. KILL has residual SPID TOCTOU; cannot claim atomic identity cancellation. Idle Dispose is only communication-failure simulation, not actual partition; unusable\/unreachable observer=>UNKNOWN\/no next work\/escalation. No native\/prod recovery or physical allocation reclaimed claims from this functional probe.\nFor auto stats verify old OFF lab limitation, explicit existing sync\/async\/lowpriority\/compat\/state capture, plain unfiltered COUNT only, actual plan\/OptimizerStatsUsage vs namedstats timestamps\/modcounter\/rows before\/after, bounded cumulative observation windows and async\/XE limitations. No universal COUNT triggers\/never triggers claim and no production blanket flag toggles. For operational bridge examine blank plus FILLED independent restored copy and dedicated replica examples, explicit fictional illustrative_not_measured data not recommended thresholds, shared CPU\/memory\/storage\/device\/network\/primary effects, actual caps mechanism verification or HOLD, metric source\/privileges\/unavailable not0, normal variability, detection\/aggregate\/delivery\/decision\/cancel\/rollback\/jitter upper budget vs measured time-to-risk not conversion from p99msdelta, recovery\/owner and pending-arrival SLO accounting. MySQL MDL\/undo\/applier + SQL request\/TX\/version\/PVS\/AG primary recovery concrete observations. Ordinary COUNT no rowlock does not mean zero MDL; no new intentional contention injection. Do not insist on full performance grid or real network partition experiment where guide explicitly defers all unverified cases safely. Request experiment only indispensable to a current operative claim; doc correction is sufficient when it removes that claim.\nFirst form independent findings. \nReturn concise JSON accepted(bool), decision accepted\/rejected, documentHashes exact current 4doc hashes, findings with stableid\/severity high|middle|low and concrete scenario\/fix, requestedExperiments, reviewQuestions {betterMethods,designCoverage,omissions,lockFactors,fastCount}, coverageReport mapping Issue1 items1-4 to evidence\/pass or fail, reviewEvidence paths\/hashes\/observations. No high\/middle or indispensable experiment may remain at acceptance. Aggregate acceptance.json pending until both reviews finish; do not require prior accepted receipt. Do not waive defects. Low optional improvements can remain if no unsafe recommendation.\n\nExact inputs: {\"documents\": {\"docs\/guidelines\/mysql.md\": \"ffb3ae5b8d189b90418c9fb9efa8e5d2787c2bcae328a60e9c3fedcf907c2b2f\", \"docs\/guidelines\/sql-server.md\": \"bbfdada6f71acc91010c8457c076cae1b79d00e6aac07247ff6f66ec547ff47c\", \"docs\/README.md\": \"9783f53da8b3e4613628d3f6798d7f5753cbcf9be3a7fadd9e6b7c67c27c48a3\", \"docs\/guidelines\/operations-runbook.md\": \"27ae9f91f863acb759abf913459755f502108af33c4524650e214ce1e2cf73d1\"}, \"baselineSha256\": \"f35110a6fab261ab7021c8f2e4f7976b6f888f18c311446bd09b5387c78b2f1e\", \"issueSha256\": \"5f94a59773fec11f737812e7f69d105e2b5bbf7c33e51638b607451779fbe3b9\", \"ownerProofSha256\": \"56a995a783884baa76a0194d4a53ebc63b3855f10b402751fdf3e4168f3654f8\", \"ownerAuditSha256\": \"d50ff3cb01b3fdb00dd1d5ae88aca2b340f5deef1e37c5d6f2fa14ebccad5ee3\", \"runtimeArchiveManifestSha256\": \"f8e81e1e1d4adc9ba7a0d6fffe8e2eeafd4e12231ec59cb12b6dab3a74daeef6\", \"sourceHashes\": {\"sqlserver\/issue1\/lab.rb\": \"7401978cd34d13111e8a763c457cce4ba972885ce7de0b6b0c3615f8260cc437\", \"sqlserver\/issue1\/mise.toml\": \"9200d44b709fb4266977ad0eea81e11a56849d716c14e901706fe946f8092e4c\", \"sqlserver\/issue1\/compose.yaml\": \"1826cfb7e8ac74f869b93c4415e039357ebe224f389d3faa9c43f9fc12f27b3a\", \"sqlserver\/issue1\/Dockerfile\": \"fc330088772578d04b795cd5630ddebe7c58c0ff4e3b74f9e8acf0b58bdd5f90\", \"sqlserver\/issue1\/.dockerignore\": \"f4a08bffb3077b9356083081520f9987342a4988dd06574763311c2b776417d4\", \"sqlserver\/issue1\/CountIssue1.csproj\": \"e63af41a60a9e3ceb49db23c993e00f37128cab8e6b4cc25df61a6d52f8c2de0\", \"sqlserver\/issue1\/NuGet.Config\": \"fd6836e883aa6bf334e587a02ff7239f68713f4baac6d749f743a2b489b1769c\", \"sqlserver\/issue1\/packages.lock.json\": \"9f4ed17378bdc9695074f16496aa31c416c7ef227d7c2b948078c852a6fa59a8\", \"sqlserver\/issue1\/Program.cs\": \"2de684668ce01307b4a4f514c3979cdeb6cb579eadacbaee3b204495e8c17e96\", \"sqlserver\/issue1\/runbook-example-inputs.json\": \"5ffd82e6295f0003e86c31dd2c5defbb18cade1d381b6d99fb0b80124d588e0b\", \"sqlserver\/issue1\/README.md\": \"0a5da3b23737b0d1e89ab8fb53ef4e7de2bf1602579b4f25a68e33ba4a576d73\", \"sqlserver\/issue1\/verify_author.py\": \"e647f6d794ccd32c5e186431cc7ea433ce22d547b4002127f933874e2f109f5a\"}}","systemPromptText":"Runtime variables are available under `runtimeVariables`. Use this JSON as the authoritative runtimeVariables object:\n`$rielaElidedKeys` lists message payload keys whose values equal the top-level runtimeVariables entry of the same name; `$rielaSameAs` points to an identical payload elsewhere in this object.\n{\"_rielaInput\":{\"communicationIds\":[],\"messages\":[],\"sourceStepIds\":[],\"stepId\":\"review\",\"workflowExecutionId\":\"temp-issue1-final-engineer-sol-session-44\"}}\n\nRequired output contract: your output payload must be one JSON object satisfying the following authored JSON Schema.\nReturn the object directly, without Markdown fences or explanatory prose, unless the task requires routing metadata.\nWhen routing metadata is required, use {\"when\": {\"condition\": true}, \"payload\": {...}}; the schema applies to payload, not the routing envelope.\n{\"additionalProperties\":true,\"properties\":{\"accepted\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"coverageReport\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"decision\":{\"enum\":[\"accepted\",\"rejected\"]},\"documentHashes\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"findings\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"requestedExperiments\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"reviewEvidence\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"reviewQuestions\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"required\":[\"accepted\",\"decision\",\"documentHashes\",\"findings\",\"requestedExperiments\",\"reviewQuestions\",\"coverageReport\",\"reviewEvidence\"],\"type\":\"object\"}"},"lastBackendEventAt":"2026-11-08T01:42:57Z","lastBackendEventType":"agent_message_chunk","nodeId":"review","recentBackendEvents":[{"at":"2026-11-08T01:39:43Z","channel":"assistant","content":"指定された4文書とIssue 1の実装・生ログを読み取り、ハッシュと各要件の根拠を独立に確認します。Docker、DB、計測、ワークフローは起動しません。","eventType":"agent_message_chunk","sequence":1},{"at":"2026-11-08T01:40:10Z","channel":"assistant","content":"本文は、所有確認・取消後のtransaction追跡・自動統計・運用判断を具体化しています。続いて、5経路の生データと実行planを照合し、文書の記述が観測範囲を超えていないか確認します。","eventType":"agent_message_chunk","sequence":2},{"at":"2026-11-08T01:41:41Z","channel":"assistant","content":"4文書、保護対象362ファイル、実装12ファイル、runtime archiveのハッシュは一致しました。生ログでは、error／Cancel／timeout後にrequestが消えてもtransactionとsnapshotが残る状態、その後のrollback・管理KILL・保持解除を確認しました。統計planも、文書が述べる限定的な観測結果と整合しています。","eventType":"agent_message_chunk","sequence":3},{"at":"2026-11-08T01:42:57Z","channel":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"accepted\": true,\n  \"decision\": \"accepted\",\n  \"documentHashes\": {\n    \"docs\/guidelines\/mysql.md\": \"ffb3ae5b8d189b90418c9fb9efa8e5d2787c2bcae328a60e9c3fedcf907c2b2f\",\n    \"docs\/guidelines\/sql-server.md\": \"bbfdada6f71acc91010c8457c076cae1b79d00e6aac07247ff6f66ec547ff47c\",\n    \"docs\/README.md\": \"9783f53da8b3e4613628d3f6798d7f5753cbcf9be3a7fadd9e6b7c67c27c48a3\",\n    \"docs\/guidelines\/operations-runbook.md\": \"27ae9f91f863acb759abf913459755f502108af33c4524650e214ce1e2cf73d1\"\n  },\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"requestedExperiments\": [],\n  \"reviewQuestions\": {\n    \"betterMethods\": \"既存export、参考metadata、適格な隔離先での正確snapshotという選択順は妥当。常時計数等は整合性設計を要する別経路として扱われている。\",\n    \"designCoverage\": \"Issue 1の4項目を満たす。実装と生証跡を独立に照合し、追加必須実験は認めなかった。\",\n    \"omissions\": \"実partition、native性能、本番SLO、物理割当回収、最小権限構成の全面認定は未検証として安全に留保されている。今回の機能確認からの外挿はない。\",\n    \"lockFactors\": \"MySQLの行ロックとMDL、SQL Serverのlocking RCとversioning・Sch-S、自動統計の追加作業を区別。意図的なDB競合注入を新規採用していない。\",\n    \"fastCount\": \"必要精度・鮮度・追加費用で選定し、普遍的最速、COUNT(1)高速化、推定値の正確値化、安全な行数閾値を主張していない。\"\n  },\n  \"coverageReport\": {\n    \"item1\": {\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Program.csのInitialize\/ReadIdentity\/Same\/GuardedKillとprobe.jsonを確認。5経路すべてで別SqlConnectionからCONTEXT_INFO、SPID、login_time、サーバーconnection_id、login\/original login、app、DB、serverを照合。ClientConnectionIdは実際にサーバーIDと異なる。tag\/time\/connection_idの3不一致はKILLを拒否し、元接続のSELECT 1が成功。権限preflightとrestricted observerの部分可視性を区別し、不可を不在と扱わない。\"\n    },\n    \"item2\": {\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"evidence\": \"server_error、client_cancel、command_timeoutはfinally前にrequestなし・sleeping・open TX=1・snapshotありを記録。保持TX IDは順に3077、3399、3671。元接続rollbackが成功。idle DisposeのTX3915はsession消失まで追跡。management_fallbackのTX4128はrollback失敗注入後にguard付きKILLを実行。全経路でsession\/request\/TX\/snapshot\/active_transactionsの不在を確認。cleanupはwork tokenと独立した30秒tokenを使用。KILLのSPID TOCTOU、observer不通時UNKNOWN・再投入停止・引継ぎ、Disposeと実分断の違いが明記されている。\"\n    },\n    \"item3\": {\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"evidence\": \"旧labのauto stats OFF条件を明示。新probeはOFF\/sync ON\/async ON、compatibility 170、RCSI\/SNAPSHOT、ADR、既存low-priority設定を保存。3実planは無条件COUNT_BIG、実scan行数4096、OptimizerStatsUsageなし。fixture_value統計はrows=1024、modification_counter=7168のまま、更新時刻も累積約0\/1\/4秒の窓で不変。未初期化PK統計はNULLを保持。XE未収集・async窓外の限界を明示し、普遍的発火／不発火や本番flag一律変更を推奨しない。\"\n    },\n    \"item4\": {\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"evidence\": \"空欄templateと記入済み独立復元先／専用replica例を確認。全数値と人物・証拠はillustrative_not_measured。共有資源inventory、実device\/親階層までのcap検証、指標source\/権限、通常変動、停止・回復責任者が具体化されている。停止上界12秒と別根拠の20\/24秒余裕を比較し、p99差を秒へ換算しない。未制御SAN\/network・primary回収不明のreplica例はHOLD。pending到着を除外しない。MySQL MDL\/undo\/applierとSQL request\/TX\/version\/PVS\/AG primary回収の観測・取得不能分岐を確認。\"\n    },\n    \"scope\": \"独立engineer査読としてIssue 1修正を受入。本番SLO・性能・物理領域回収の認定ではない。集約acceptance.jsonは両役査読後に対象hashへ結び付ける。\"\n  },\n  \"reviewEvidence\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"results\/reviews\/issue-1\/baseline.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"f35110a6fab261ab7021c8f2e4f7976b6f888f18c311446bd09b5387c78b2f1e\",\n      \"observations\": \"AGENTS.mdとissue.jsonを全文読了。protectedFiles全362件を実bytesから再計算し不一致なし。修正前archiveの文書3件と旧receipt\/auditもmanifest一致。旧受入の文書hashはarchiveと一致し、現行版へ転用されていない。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"results\/reviews\/issue-1\/issue.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"5f94a59773fec11f737812e7f69d105e2b5bbf7c33e51638b607451779fbe3b9\",\n      \"observations\": \"4項目の修正・受入条件と現行文書・実装を照合。未解決のhigh\/middle指摘なし。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"results\/reviews\/issue-1\/owner-proof.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"56a995a783884baa76a0194d4a53ebc63b3855f10b402751fdf3e4168f3654f8\",\n      \"ownerAuditPath\": \"results\/reviews\/issue-1\/owner-audit.json\",\n      \"ownerAuditSha256\": \"d50ff3cb01b3fdb00dd1d5ae88aca2b340f5deef1e37c5d6f2fa14ebccad5ee3\",\n      \"observations\": \"実装12ファイルの実hashが指定入力、owner-proof sourceHashes、runtime resultのsource_before\/source_afterと完全一致。aggregate passedフラグだけに依存せず生証跡を確認した。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"results\/reference\/issue-1-runtime-20261108T013522-6bd01cec80ff\/manifest.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"f8e81e1e1d4adc9ba7a0d6fffe8e2eeafd4e12231ec59cb12b6dab3a74daeef6\",\n      \"probeSha256\": \"c188f405dfbf1535af9f02203807ba7cbd3fc7a569df73d3b4163f4e62e75ad7\",\n      \"resultSha256\": \"d74a9ab419c810eb14a97023c5d5c177f0657e4a635f151d3d674d0a6d5d6f41\",\n      \"observations\": \"manifest全8ファイル、result内artifact hash、元runとarchiveのbytesが一致。probeの85イベントはcontroller stdoutのイベントと一致。3実plan XMLを独立解析し、runtime counterと統計観測を確認した。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"completeLogPath\": \"results\/reference\/issue-1-runtime-20261108T013522-6bd01cec80ff\/controller.log\",\n      \"sha256\": \"be15774a76a4e7ca555982fd83c70b22a144e59d2ae49834972a8965057c463a\",\n      \"finalExitStatus\": 0,\n      \"clientExitStatus\": 0,\n      \"observations\": \"全32 CLIが終了code 0、timeoutなし。client終了・controller最終markerあり。container\/volume\/networkと生成imageのrun所有labelを確認し、同じ所有資源だけを削除。最終inventoryに専用資源なし。canonical foreground invocationも終了code 0。今回の査読ではDocker\/DB\/計測・workflowを起動せず、ファイル変更・委譲を行っていない。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"observations\": \"主要仕様も公式資料と照合。CONTEXT_INFOのDMV可視性は[SET CONTEXT_INFO](https:\/\/learn.microsoft.com\/en-us\/sql\/t-sql\/statements\/set-context-info-transact-sql?view=sql-server-ver17)、attentionの捕捉限界は[TRY\/CATCH](https:\/\/learn.microsoft.com\/en-us\/sql\/t-sql\/language-elements\/try-catch-transact-sql?view=sql-server-ver17)、async背景処理・低priority設定は[Statistics](https:\/\/learn.microsoft.com\/en-us\/sql\/relational-databases\/statistics\/statistics?view=sql-server-ver17)と整合する。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","eventType":"agent_message_chunk","sequence":4}],"status":"completed","stepId":"review","streamedResponseText":"指定された4文書とIssue 1の実装・生ログを読み取り、ハッシュと各要件の根拠を独立に確認します。Docker、DB、計測、ワークフローは起動しません。本文は、所有確認・取消後のtransaction追跡・自動統計・運用判断を具体化しています。続いて、5経路の生データと実行planを照合し、文書の記述が観測範囲を超えていないか確認します。4文書、保護対象362ファイル、実装12ファイル、runtime archiveのハッシュは一致しました。生ログでは、error／Cancel／timeout後にrequestが消えてもtransactionとsnapshotが残る状態、その後のrollback・管理KILL・保持解除を確認しました。統計planも、文書が述べる限定的な観測結果と整合しています。{\n  \"accepted\": true,\n  \"decision\": \"accepted\",\n  \"documentHashes\": {\n    \"docs\/guidelines\/mysql.md\": \"ffb3ae5b8d189b90418c9fb9efa8e5d2787c2bcae328a60e9c3fedcf907c2b2f\",\n    \"docs\/guidelines\/sql-server.md\": \"bbfdada6f71acc91010c8457c076cae1b79d00e6aac07247ff6f66ec547ff47c\",\n    \"docs\/README.md\": \"9783f53da8b3e4613628d3f6798d7f5753cbcf9be3a7fadd9e6b7c67c27c48a3\",\n    \"docs\/guidelines\/operations-runbook.md\": \"27ae9f91f863acb759abf913459755f502108af33c4524650e214ce1e2cf73d1\"\n  },\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"requestedExperiments\": [],\n  \"reviewQ